  "firstFailures": [
    "The first web typecheck reported three missing useRef initial arguments and thirteen resulting undefined-assignment errors under React 19 types. Refs now explicitly include undefined and initialize it. The corrected typecheck, complete check and every browser run pass. No failed output was discarded."
  ],
  "reviewRefinements": [
    "Final history fetches clear earlier content on errors and refresh on summary changes or recovered status polling. Late output usage and cleanup reasons can update without another status transition.",
    "Browser checks exposed no functional failure. Review removed a deliberate wait for a disabled empty-question button, added a held-response question-edit case, avoided duplicate header detail, and clarified omitted-path and request-replay wording. Saved input no longer implies that a failed/preflight attempt dispatched a model.",
    "The full 938-test check ran at c92349a. Subsequent changes refine only UI copy/detail duplication and matching smoke text; strict production web builds, the complete prepared browser smoke and source/emitted audit ran again at the final executable. Backend, schema, parser and provider code remain unchanged after the full check."
  ],
